The speech model's audio decoding (crates/server/src/speech/audio.rs) uses the
symphonia crates (0.6.1, pdeljanov/Symphonia), unmodified, as a dependency,
for WAV, FLAC, MP3, AAC and the Ogg, MP4 and Matroska containers. They are
licensed under the Mozilla Public License, Version 2.0, whose copyleft binds
only the files of those crates, which ignis does not change; their source is
available from crates.io.

The diarizer (crates/speech/src/diarizer/, spec speech/08) ports Nemotron 3
Diarization's graph and streaming state from the checkpoint's Transformers
code, huggingface/transformers tag v5.20.2 (commit 18329f10),
src/transformers/models/nemotron3_diarization/
(Copyright 2026 The HuggingFace Inc. team), which restates the streaming
Sortformer of NVIDIA NeMo (Copyright NVIDIA CORPORATION), restated in Rust
rather than copied verbatim (ADR 0051). Both are licensed under the Apache
License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE). Its weights, nvidia/Nemotron-3-Diarization,
are not in this repository or its build: they are converted to a GGUF file by
tools/speech-diarizer/convert.py and distributed beside it under their own
licence, the OpenMDW License Agreement, version 1.1
(https://openmdw.ai/license/1-1/).
